    "[M22] L2-MATH: Power": "Say \"2 ** 10 = 1024\"\n",
    "[M23] L2-STR: Concatenation": "Say \"Hello, World!\"\n",
    "[M24] L2-STR: Uppercase": "Say \"HELLO\"\n",
    "[M25] L2-STR: Lowercase": "Say \"hello\"\n",
